<title>USA: Northwestern Public Service sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Northwestern Public Service sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HURON, S.D. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northwestern Public Service said Wednesday it intends to effect a two-for-one stock split at its May 7 board meeting.</p>
<p>If the split is authorized, it would result in the issuance of an additional 8.9 million shares. The record date for the split would be May 19, it said.</p>
